      {
        "page": 3,
        "total_pages": 3,
        "content": [
          "Two cues live here and almost nowhere",
          "else: pa and ku, the place classes.",
          "",
          "   pa   mahali    a place, a spot",
          "   ku   kushoto   the left-hand side",
          "        kuume     the right-hand side",
          "",
          "Hear them:                         Press 1",
          "",
          "pa points at a definite spot, ku at a",
          "general direction. Neither takes a",
          "plural — a place is simply a place.",
          "",
          "The class rules agreement too:",
          "mahali pazuri, a good place.",
          "",
          "See ku or pa in the grey slot and the",
          "word is somewhere, not something."
        ],
        "pronunciation_mappings": {
          "1": "Mahali. Kushoto. Kuume."
        }
      }
